  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪が、一番たくさんの人を笑顔にしたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001060020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふ……はい",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600106/6016001060020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001060030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "たくさんの方が笑っていて、\r\nでも、笑顔は一人ひとりからしか生まれない……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600106/6016001060030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001060040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "一つひとつ、笑顔も違うんです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600106/6016001060040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001060050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "なにか、そんなことを思って……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600106/6016001060050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001060060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……すみません\r\n私、もう言葉が出てこなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600106/6016001060060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪。俺は、ステージを見て──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最初に千雪の笑顔を見たときと\r\n同じような気持ちになった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪の思う通りに、やりたいことを突き通してきて\r\nきっと、よかったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪は、すごいアイドルだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001060070,
